{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Scope a property turnover"},"description":"Turns move-out inspection findings for a US rental unit into a priced make-ready scope. For a first estimate use property_turnover_quick_estimate (plain words). Inputs: property (ZIP, bedrooms, bathrooms, optional details) and findings, each an issue code from property_turnover_issue_codes with rooms, status, quantity and the original words (source_text); optional rate_card, decisions, detail. Returns tasks by trade, low/expected/high costs, priorities, vendor scopes, refer-outs, assumptions, unknowns and download links. Not for: diagnosing hazards, legal advice on deposits, remodel bids, properties outside the US.\nDeterministic and source-cited: the same input gives the same result.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"Area":{"enum":["whole_unit","kitchen","living_room","dining_room","bedroom","bathroom","hallway","entry","laundry","closet","garage","patio_balcony","exterior","yard","other"],"type":"string"},"Constraints":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"access_notes":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string"},"occupied":{"default":false,"description":"Work happens while occupied.","type":"boolean"},"target_ready_date":{"format":"date","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"Decision":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Owner decision. Re-run the same request with decisions to get the approved scope.","properties":{"action":{"enum":["approve","decline","defer"],"type":"string"},"finding_id":{"type":"string"},"line_id":{"type":"string"},"note":{"maxLength":300,"type":"string"}},"required":["action"],"type":"object"},"Evidence":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"A negative or working result clears: inspector any hazard; lab mold, lead, asbestos, drugs, sewage; meter moisture; self_test or checklist a device.","properties":{"kind":{"$ref":"#/$defs/EvidenceKind","type":"string"},"material":{"description":"Wh